{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A run saved inside Sub (run.snapshot, written by Record.goal) resumed in this test's own app goes on from its save:\nthe save answers again, Sub's next step reads the context's %name% and its frame's %city%, and Record goes on after\nthe call. The step before the save doesn't run again (%count% stays 1). The resumed Record writes its snapshot to\n%where%, which this test points into its own workspace, so the committed run.snapshot stays as it is.",
